	(text "Mics: corners of a 66 x 66 mm square on the top side, in XMOS's square order (stock -sqr firmware): DATA0 far-left, DATA1 USB-side left, DATA2 USB-\nside right, DATA3 far-right. XVF pins: DATA0 46, 1 50, 2 48, 3 51.\nMic SELECT tied to GND, as on XMOS's board. Amp: MAX98357A, 9 dB (GAIN_SLOT open), (L+R)/2; its load switch EN is XVF3800 pin 40.\nMAX98357A: SD_MODE 1M to VDD with the internal 100k pull-down gives 0.45 V = (L+R)/2 mode. The load switch removes amp power when the XVF3800 drops\npin 40."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14.54 182.8982 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "0cbdbf30-aa90-56e4-b6e0-3d10c29d7dd5")
	)
